OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showery
OL,6,Frain in the south soon clearing to
OL,7,Fleave a fine evening for most. Largely
OL,8,Fdry overnight with clear periods.
OL,9,FStaying quite breezy on northern
OL,10,Fcoasts but winds becoming light
OL,11,Felsewhere and turning rather cool in
OL,12,Frural inland locations.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FA fine day with a mixture of
OL,15,Fcloud and sunny spells, with some
OL,16,Fprolonged periods of sunshine
OL,17,Fdeveloping in places. Much lighter
OL,18,Fwinds than on Saturday and feeling
OL,19,Fpleasantly warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
