OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FCloudier on Monday with a little
OL,7,Fdrizzle possible for a time, brighter
OL,8,Flater. More widely brighter on Tuesday
OL,9,Fwith warm periods of sunshine.
OL,10,FBreezier on Wednesday, with some rain
OL,11,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
